! array-param: using arrays as parameters in prototypes is not standard
  @ test.idl:3:40

 2 │ interface Test {
 3 │     void process_array(in long data[10]);
   │                                ˆˆˆˆ this parameter is an array
 4 │     void process_matrix(in double matrix[3][3]);
 5 │     void process_string_array(in string names[3]);

  * standard IDL does not permit arrays as parameters

